a>-->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"EventDescriptionLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--<h3 class=\"TabsSec_Title\">MAIN INFO</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ShortInfoLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>DIRECTOR: CARY JOJI FUKUNAGA</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>STARRING: DANIEL CRAIG, RALPH FIENNES, NAOMIE HARRIS, RAMI MALEK, LÉA SEYDOUX</p> \n\t\t\t\t<p>CERTIFICATE: 12A</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>-->\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"whatson-event-details-content MobileAccordian_info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--hide-on-mobile-->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>&#8220;It haunts us</em><b><em>&#8220;</em> </b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Roger Ebert</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience the chilling power of <em><strong>Nosferatu</strong></em>, the legendary 1922 silent classic that defined cinematic horror. This special screening invites you into a world of creeping shadows, haunting atmosphere, and unforgettable imagery as Count Orlok stalks the screen with eerie elegance. </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">With a brand new live score,</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> the film’s tension and terror are reborn. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to witness a masterpiece restored to the silver screen.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\"> </span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Piano score composed and performed by <strong>Sam Watts</strong></span><strong> </strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!--<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"Tickets_in\">\n\t\t\t<!--<a href=\"#\" class=\"MobileAccordianBtn\">Tickets & Times</a>--\n\t\t</div>-->\n\t\t<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane EventDetails_Video\" id=\"VideoTabs\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"EventDetailsVideo_inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"Blankbanner_img\" src=\"/wp-content/plugins/whats-on/images/blankImg_video.png\" alt=\"Event Details Video\">\n\t\t\t\t<style>.EventDetails_Video{display:none;}</style><h4>Video Not Found</h4>\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"whatson-event-terms-link-area\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"whatson-event-terms-link\" href=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/about-our-music/terms-and-conditions/\" target=\"_blank\"> Terms and Conditions </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t </div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t<script>\n\t\tjQuery('.WarningSms_drop button').ready(function() {\n\t\t\tjQuery('.WarningSms_drop button').click(function(){\t\t\t\n\t\t\tjQuery('.WarningSms_drop').toggleClass('show');\n\t\t});\n});\n\t\t\n\t</script>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\tjQuery('.repeat-toggle').click(function()\n{\n     jQuery(this).toggleClass('open'); //Adds 'a', removes 'b' and vice versa\n});\n//Mobile tabs accordian////////\t\njQuery('.tab-pane .MobileAccordianBtn').click(function (e) {\n\te.preventDefault();\n\tvar $this = $(this);\n\t$this.addClass('active');\n\tjQuery('.tab-pane .MobileAccordianBtn').removeClass('active');\n\t$this.addClass('active');\n\tif ($this.next().hasClass('show')) {\n\t\t$this.next().removeClass('show');\n\t\tjQuery('.tab-pane .MobileAccordianBtn').removeClass('active');;\n\t} else {\n\t\t$this.parent().parent().find('.MobileAccordian_info').removeClass('show');\n\t\t$this.parent().parent().find('.MobileAccordian_info').slideUp(350);\n\t\t$this.next().toggleClass('show');\n\t}\n});\t\n\t\n</script>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"whatson-event-view-tags-link-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"whatson-sinlge-event-king-info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                             <!--<h3 style=\"margin-bottom:7px\" class=\"join_friends\"><span>Join our Friends to save money and enjoy priority booking on selected shows!</span></h3>\n                                             <div class=\"social-list become_friend\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 cla