            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html class=\"no-js\" lang=\"en-GB\">\n\n\t<head>\n\n\t\t<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\t\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" >\n\n\t\t<link rel=\"profile\" href=\"https://gmpg.org/xfn/11\">\n\t\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/templates/images/favicon.png\"/>\n\t\t<!--<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.12.4.js\"></script>-->\n\t\t<meta name='robots' content='index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1' />\n\n<!-- Google Tag Manager for WordPress by gtm4wp.com -->\n<script data-cfasync=\"false\" data-pagespeed-no-defer>\n\tvar gtm4wp_datalayer_name = \"dataLayer\";\n\tvar dataLayer = dataLayer || [];\n</script>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager for WordPress by gtm4wp.com -->\n\t<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.1 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n\t<title>Pandora&#039;s Box (1929) with live score - Wilton&#039;s Music Hall</title>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/whats-on/pandoras-box-1929-with-live-score/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Pandora&#039;s Box (1929) with live score - Wilton&#039;s Music Hall\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"“You should only play when you&#8217;re sure to win”   Louise Brooks stars as the effortlessly seductive Lulu, a high class courtesan and dancer who brings destruction to the Berlin bourgeoisie with her turbulent love affairs, both male and female.    Heavily censored in its day, G.W. Pabst&#8216;s 1929 Weimar masterpiece nonetheless launched flapper icon Brooks [&hellip;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/whats-on/pandoras-box-1929-with-live-score/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Wilton&#039;s Music Hall\" />\n\t<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=