Type\">Tickets & Times</a></li>-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#media_gallery_1_in\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" class=\"textType\">GALLERY</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t<div class=\"tab-content\">\n\t\t<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"Details_in\">\n\t\t\t<!--<a href=\"#\" class=\"MobileAccordianBtn\">Description</a>-->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"EventDescriptionLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--<h3 class=\"TabsSec_Title\">MAIN INFO</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ShortInfoLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>DIRECTOR: CARY JOJI FUKUNAGA</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>STARRING: DANIEL CRAIG, RALPH FIENNES, NAOMIE HARRIS, RAMI MALEK, LÉA SEYDOUX</p> \n\t\t\t\t<p>CERTIFICATE: 12A</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>-->\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"whatson-event-details-content MobileAccordian_info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!--hide-on-mobile-->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Live piano score from <strong>Tom Marlow</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the twisted fairground of the night, where shadows sharpen like knives and the mind plays its most dangerous tricks. <em><strong>The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari (1920)</strong></em> unfolds like a nightmare: jagged streets tilt against impossible skies, doors gape like mouths, and every angle threatens a secret. At its heart lurks the enigmatic Dr. Caligari and his sleepwalking pawn, Cesare—an ominous duo whose presence stains the town with dread. What is performance, and what is control?</p>\n<p>This landmark of German Expressionism still crackles with menace and wonder, and is brought to life with a brand new piano score from <strong>Tom Marlow</strong> of <strong>The Lucky Dog Picturehouse</strong>.</p>\n<p><em>“Silent Film has no finer custodians”</em> Nicholas Barber, BBC Culture</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Musicians of <strong>The Lucky Dog Picturehouse</strong> are dedicated to recreating the original cinema experience; bringing together classic silent films and live, period specific music. They have performed and lectured at BFI Southbank, LoCo Film Festival, London Transport Museum and numerous other venues across the UK.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!--<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane active\" id=\"Tickets_in\">\n\t\t\t<!--<a href=\"#\" class=\"MobileAccordianBtn\">Tickets & Times</a>--\n\t\t</div>-->\n\t\t<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane EventDetails_Video\" id=\"VideoTabs\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"EventDetailsVideo_inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"Blankbanner_img\" src=\"/wp-content/plugins/whats-on/images/blankImg_video.png\" alt=\"Event Details Video\">\n\t\t\t\t<style>.EventDetails_Video{display:none;}</style><h4>Video Not Found</h4>\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane GALLERY\" id=\"media_gallery_1_in\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"MobileAccordian_info\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-gallery bg-cream\">\r\n\t\t<ul class=\"media-grid gallery_list\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"GalleryItems_Img\"><!--class=\"wplightbox\"-->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a data-fslightbox=\"gallery\" title=\"Example title\" data-caption=\"<span class='Caption'></span>\" href=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Lucky-Dog-PictureHouse-The-Cabinet-of-Dr-Caligari-1024x575.jpg\"  data-group=\"gallery0\" style=\"background-image: url('https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Lucky-Dog-PictureHouse-The-Cabinet-of-Dr-Caligari-360x360.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"BlankItem_img\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/suredigital-starter/assets/images/gallery_blank.png\" alt=\" Blank\">\n\t\t\t\t<!--<img width=\"360\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Lucky-Dog-PictureHouse-The-Cabinet-of-Dr-Caligari-360x360.jpg\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Lucky-Dog-PictureHouse-The-Cabinet-of-Dr-Caligari-360x360.jpg 360w, https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Lucky-Dog-PictureHouse-The-Cabinet-of-Dr-Caligari-150x150.jpg 150w, https://wiltons.org.uk/wp-co